00:29:01.230 --> 00:29:03.210
in business, a little more than that now,

00:29:03.210 --> 00:29:06.470
and I can tell you, I had
no background in business.

00:29:06.470 --> 00:29:08.760
What made me as effective
was that I wouldn't

00:29:08.760 --> 00:29:10.500
get involved in a business
just to make money.

00:29:10.500 --> 00:29:12.530
I'm involved with a business
'cause it's a mission,

00:29:12.530 --> 00:29:14.383
it's something that I think
can change somebody's life.

00:29:14.383 --> 00:29:16.380
And whether it's something as simple as

00:29:16.380 --> 00:29:18.900
the stem cell business,
or whether it's LAFC,

00:29:18.900 --> 00:29:22.490
a soccer team I own, or
whether it's a resort in Fiji,

00:29:22.490 --> 00:29:24.440
I try to do something that's
going to change their lives,

00:29:24.440 --> 00:29:27.050
and the whole focus in
business is add more value.

00:29:27.050 --> 00:29:28.360
There is no other rule.

00:29:28.360 --> 00:29:30.550
If you do more for others
than anybody else does

00:29:30.550 --> 00:29:32.480
in the marketplace, you'll build a brand.

00:29:32.480 --> 00:29:35.390
People get on their knees
and reach behind a soda pop

00:29:35.390 --> 00:29:37.670
to get a Coca-Cola, even
though Coke doesn't win

00:29:37.670 --> 00:29:39.930
most of the taste tests, it is the brand.

00:29:39.930 --> 00:29:42.690
You'll become the brand if
you can do more for others

00:29:42.690 --> 00:29:45.040
than anybody else does, and
I hope that your audience,

00:29:45.040 --> 00:29:46.030
the reason they're listening to you,

00:29:46.030 --> 00:29:47.970
is to figure out how to
add more and more value

00:29:47.970 --> 00:29:48.940
to the marketplace.

00:29:48.940 --> 00:29:49.970
And the last thing I'll say to them

00:29:49.970 --> 00:29:50.803
since they're entrepreneurs

00:29:50.803 --> 00:29:53.110
is find who your ideal customer is,

00:29:53.110 --> 00:29:54.580
and build your business around that.

00:29:54.580 --> 00:29:56.420
The customer that's going
to do the most with you,

00:29:56.420 --> 00:29:57.713
the customer that's
going to refer the most,

00:29:57.713 --> 00:30:00.050
the customer that when winter does come,

00:30:00.050 --> 00:30:01.330
will still buy from you.

00:30:01.330 --> 00:30:02.944
Find out who that is and over-service them

00:30:02.944 --> 00:30:05.760
and you will have no difficulty
growing your business.

00:30:05.760 --> 00:30:07.580
- Tony Robbins, ladies and gentlemen.

00:30:07.580 --> 00:30:09.860
Thank you so much, man,
I'll see you in November,

00:30:09.860 --> 00:30:11.710
and I really appreciate
you taking the time today.

00:30:11.710 --> 00:30:13.960
- Thanks for having me
on, take care brother.

